@startuml
!include ../themes/proveo.puml
skinparam noteTextAlignment left
' SPEC: _spec/_plans/tutorial-interactive-siege.puml
' purpose: siege is already taught as gated live lessons — not a film
' status: OUTDATED — shipped runner; product = StarChess
' covers: apps/starchess/src/tutorial/tutorialScript.config.ts
'         apps/starchess/src/screens/TutorialScreen.tsx
' live spec: _spec/apps/starchess/architecture/storybook-projection.puml
'            _spec/apps/starchess/menu-flow.puml
' Notes are capped at 5 lines x 50 columns; one idea per anchor.
title OUTDATED — tutorial is already a gated match;\ndo not build a second siege mode

component "TUTORIAL_SCRIPT_CONFIG" as CFG <<app>>
component "TutorialScreen\nlive engine + gates" as RUN <<app>>
component "rook-siege · tank\nlessons" as SIEGE <<app>>
component "**a film of a siege**" as SLIDE <<error>>

CFG ARROW_MAIN RUN
RUN ARROW_MAIN SIEGE
SLIDE ARROW_ERROR RUN

note bottom of RUN
  **The player already issues legal
  actions against live rules.**
  completeWhen / restartWhen gate
  the beat; there is no siege mode
  flag to invent.
end note

legend bottom
  **Do not implement this file.**
  ==
  Diff ""tutorialScript.config.ts""
  before adding a lesson. Do not
  wait on a siege-line type.
end legend
@enduml
